{
  "id": "large-term-unfolding",
  "goals": [
    "maximum recursion depth has been reached",
    "(deterministic) timeout at whnf or isDefEq",
    "a goal that holds Nat.fold, Fin.foldl, or LeanExe.loop over many rounds",
    "compiled.module or compiled.f.bound inside a goal",
    "p.f.bound (x, f y) for a call f y passed as a tuple component",
    "(kernel) deep recursion detected at a verified_compile command",
    "#print axioms lists p.f.meaning_eq or p.f.fixed",
    "toSpec b or slotsFrom b 4097 s inside a goal closed by rfl or unification",
    "a local definition introduced by set that omega or rw unfolds",
    "every case of a theorem over a parser that matches the opcode and the operands in one match runs out of heartbeats",
    "(deterministic) timeout at whnf from a show over a chain of let-bound machine states",
    "(deterministic) timeout at whnf from rfl when both sides reach Reply.field by different paths",
    "rw or simp only that does not find UInt64.ofNat 4092 in a step's result holding UInt64.ofNat ↑(4092 : Fin 4096)",
    "maximum recursion depth from rfl on x + UInt64.ofNat 4092 + 1 = x + UInt64.ofNat 4093",
    "maximum recursion depth in a concrete run over LeanExe.Bytes.build 4096 fun _ => 0",
    "(List.range g.2).map r.bytes = (List.range 4096).map f",
    "if p then … else … where p quantifies over a list that a function computes from a record",
    "excessive memory in the elaboration of a Decidable instance or of simp over a statx record of 256 bytes"
  ],
